{"path":"container/stack/push","title":"std::stack<T,Container>::push","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::stack&lt;T,Container&gt;::</span>push","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/stack/push","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Pushes the given element value to the top of the stack.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx98\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> push<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> value_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> push<span class=\"br0\">(</span> value_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Pushes the given element <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> to the top of the stack.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c.<span class=\"me1\">push_back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>value<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c.<span class=\"me1\">push_back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>value<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the value of the element to push\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Equal to the complexity of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Container<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">push_back</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>This program implements the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brainfuck\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">BrainHack</a> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain-specific_language\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">DSL</a>, when the use of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack\">std::stack</a></span> is an idiomatic way to process paired brackets.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;array&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdint&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;map&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stack&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdexcept&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">class</span> BrainHackInterpreter\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/map\"><span class=\"kw1289\">std::<span class=\"me2\">map</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> open_brackets, close_brackets<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integer\"><span class=\"kw127\">std::<span class=\"me2\">uint8_t</span></span></a>, <span class=\"nu0\">32768</span><span class=\"s